id: pm-y4aaol
title: "GH-1052: typed fail-closed whole-list SDK primitive"
description: "GitHub issue #1052 reports that package integrations duplicate incomplete whole-corpus list validation because the public SDK has no single typed primitive that proves terminal inclusion, strict reads, complete projection, zero omissions, consistent counts, and unique item identities. Add a fail-closed whole-list SDK contract with typed receipts and independent negative controls."
